# Projects

Purpose:
  Multi-project registry. Each subdirectory is a concrete project instance
  containing its own decisions, tasks, docs, stack, testing, and state.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1 @INDEX.sdd
   2 @vkard.az/INDEX.sdd
   3 @prompts/INDEX.sdd

Rules:
  [PRJ1] Each project MUST have its own subdirectory.
  [PRJ2] Formalized prompts MUST live in projects/prompts/.
  [PRJ3] Project state MUST be tracked in projects/<name>/, not in project/.
  [PRJ4] The project/ folder contains reusable schemas only; concrete data
        belongs here.
  [PRJ5] Migration commands MUST be run after any .sdd/ schema update.

Navigation:
  Prompts: @prompts/INDEX.sdd
  ProjectModel: @../project/INDEX.sdd
  VKARD: @vkard.az/INDEX.sdd
  Migration: @../commands/sdd-migrate.sdd

State: +
